[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16140.71, "timestamp": "04:29:00", "text": "たくさんの物を持っていた。それは良かった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16143.91, "timestamp": "04:29:03", "text": "楽しかった。かっこよかった。私のデビュー作のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16146.309, "timestamp": "04:29:06", "text": "まるでインド料理店を開くようなものだった。 A"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16150.469, "timestamp": "04:29:10", "text": "バーチャル・インディアン・バー。それが私のデビュー戦だった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16155.229, "timestamp": "04:29:15", "text": "うん。それはとても独創的だった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16159.07, "timestamp": "04:29:19", "text": "以前にもやったことがある。そして私は「ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16162.07, "timestamp": "04:29:22", "text": "ああ、このユーチューバーは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16165.269, "timestamp": "04:29:25", "text": "このコミュニティでは、まもなく名前が挙がるでしょう。行く"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16169.59, "timestamp": "04:29:29", "text": "近いうちに大きな波紋を呼ぶだろう。これを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16171.67, "timestamp": "04:29:31", "text": "その人は非常に大きな可能性を秘めている。それが私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16175.99, "timestamp": "04:29:35", "text": "視聴時の第一印象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16178.63, "timestamp": "04:29:38", "text": "うん。それだけ、それだけ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16179.717, "timestamp": "04:29:39", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "is there pole dancing too?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16186.309, "timestamp": "04:29:46", "text": "うん。でもまあ、大体そんな感じですね。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16187.988, "timestamp": "04:29:47", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16189.03, "timestamp": "04:29:49", "text": "でも、そうですね、その量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16192.95, "timestamp": "04:29:52", "text": "君の突飛なアイデアは本当に素晴らしいね。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16194.71, "timestamp": "04:29:54", "text": "感じる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16198.229, "timestamp": "04:29:58", "text": "えーと、この上を歩けば歩くほど"}]